# 🚀 Auto Apply + AI Interview System — Step Wise Tasks

## 1. Settings Page Development

### 1.1 Create Settings Module

* Create `/settings` page
* Add sidebar navigation
* Add tabs:

  * General
  * Auto Apply
  * Resume
  * AI Interview
  * Email Templates
  * Cron Logs

---

## 2. Auto Apply Settings Section

### 2.1 Enable / Disable Auto Apply

* Add toggle:

  * `Enable Auto Apply`

### 2.2 Jobs Posted Date Filter

* Add dropdown:

  * Last 24 Hours
  * Last 2 Days
  * Last 1 Week
  * Last 1 Month

### 2.3 Daily Apply Limits

* Add input:

  * Maximum jobs per day
* Example:

  * 10
  * 25
  * 50
  * 100

### 2.4 Keywords Filters

* Add include keywords:

  * Node.js
  * React
  * Backend
  * Remote

### 2.5 Exclude Keywords

* Add exclude keywords:

  * Senior
  * 10 years
  * Onsite

### 2.6 Experience Filter

* Add:

  * Fresher
  * 1-3 Years
  * 3-5 Years

### 2.7 Location Filter

* Add:

  * Remote
  * India
  * USA
  * Hybrid

### 2.8 Salary Filter

* Add minimum salary filter

### 2.9 Save Settings

* Store all filters in database

---

