# 21. Recommended Tech Stack

## Frontend

* Next.js
* TypeScript
* Tailwind CSS
* Zustand

## Backend

* Node.js
* Express.js
* MongoDB/PostgreSQL

## Automation

* Playwright

## AI

* OpenAI
* Gemini
* Claude

## Email

* Nylas

## Cron

* Vercel Cron Jobs

## Storage

* AWS S3
* Cloudinary

## Authentication

* Clerk
* NextAuth

---

# 22. Main Flow

## User Flow

1. User signup
2. Upload resume
3. Save filters
4. Enable auto apply
5. Cron runs daily
6. Jobs fetched
7. Check already applied jobs
8. Extract HR emails
9. Generate AI email
10. Attach resume
11. Send email OR auto apply
12. Save applied job
13. Send report
14. Include AI interview URL in email

---

# 23. Priority Order

## Phase 1

* Settings page
* Resume upload
* Job fetching
* Cron job

## Phase 2

* Email sending
* Auto apply
* Duplicate detection

## Phase 3

* AI interview system
* AI reports
* Live URLs

## Phase 4

* AI optimization
* Advanced analytics
* Scaling
